------------------

- Ubuntu 22.04 64-bit


New in this Release:
--------------------

This is the first alpha release for the phyCORE-AM62Lx FPSC. The following interfaces are currently working:

* SD-Card
* eMMC
* QSPI-Flash
* RTC
* EEPROM
* Temperature sensors
* RS232
* RS485
* CAN FD
* 2x GBit Ethernet
* LVDS 10" Display
* ADC (onboard)
* USB 2.0

Booting is supported from:

* SD-Card
* eMMC (UDA with filesystem mode only)
* USB DFU
* UART

**Known Issues**
^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

* CAN bit rates >= 1 Mbit/s don't work
